58|/***
59| * MARK: maskNonCode
60| * @description Masks comments and string/template literals with spaces (length
61| *   and newlines preserved) so export scans never match prose or doc text.
62| * @example maskNonCode("// export const x = 1") hides the commented export
63| * @param {string} source - Raw file text.
